{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">LOAD-PICTURE statement</span>\n","class":"manual","created":2879,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309982","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/LOAD-PICTURE-statement.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/LOAD-PICTURE-statement.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"LOAD-PICTURE-statement\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">LOAD-PICTURE statement</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p osrestrict\">(Windows only; Graphical\ninterfaces only)</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns a COM-HANDLE to an OlePictureObject.\nYou can use this COM-HANDLE to set graphical properties of controls.</p>\n      <div class=\"note note note_note\"><span class=\"note__title\">Note:</span> Does not apply to SpeedScript programming.</div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"LOAD-PICTURE-statement__syntax_GC18US2696299\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d197411e102\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"LOAD-PICTURE-statement__idGDM2LL2672389\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>LOAD-PICTURE <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> <var class=\"keyword varname\">image</var> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">image</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A CHARACTER expression representing the name of the graphical file.\n            This file can have one of the following extensions: .BMP, .EMF, .ICO, .CUR, .DIB. If the\n            filename is not fully qualified, LOAD-PICTURE searches for a matching file on the user&#39;s\n            path. The filename can contain Unicode characters. See <cite class=\"cite\">OpenEdge\n              Development: Internationalizing Applications</cite> for more information about\n            Unicode.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"LOAD-PICTURE-statement__example_GC18UT2696308\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d197411e154\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">The\nfollowing program fragment illustrates the use of the LOAD-PICTURE\nstatement:</p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"LOAD-PICTURE-statement__idGDM2LM2672396\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DEFINE VARIABLE chPic     AS COM-HANDLE NO-UNDO.\nDEFINE VARIABLE chControl AS COM-HANDLE NO-UNDO.\n\n/* Get the COM-HANDLE of an Image control */\n\n/* Use LOAD-PICTURE to get a COM-HANDLE to the bitmap contained in myPic.bmp */\nchPic = <strong class=\"ph b\">LOAD-PICTURE</strong>(&quot;myPic.bmp&quot;).\n\n/* Set the control&#39;s Picture property for the bitmap */\nchControl:Picture = chPic.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LOAD-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LOAD-statement.html\">LOAD statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LOCKED-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LOCKED-function.html\">LOCKED function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309982","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":2879,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"LOAD-PICTURE statement","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LOAD-PICTURE-statement.html","type":"Manual"}